// "Destroy(patient)" ([CR#701.8a,702.12b]) — the bare-verb pattern TWIN at the
// EventFilter position, matching the Destroy keyword-action event on `patient`
// (indestructible's `Destroy(Ref(This))`, regeneration's would-watch). Expands
// to the `Act` master form; the `Dies`/`Destroyed` precedent. The single
// patient rides the master form's `on` slot (the fact's `object`); no
// performer/count is carried. The Replacement (would) lane also requires the
// event's realized Battlefield → Graveyard shape to still hold ([CR#616.1f]).
(
    name: "Destroy",
    template: "${0} is destroyed",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate],
    body: Act(verb: Destroy, on: Param(0)),
)
